Edit `content/index.md` to change this page. Add a new page by creating another
`.md` file under `content/` with a `slug:` in its front matter — for example
`content/about.md` with `slug: about` becomes `/about/`.

Run `node build.js` (or `node --watch build.js`) and serve the `dist/` folder.
